WEBVTT

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.420
<i>That</i> Arima is in a <i>duel!?</i>

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:35.820
Yes.  With van Hossen-sama.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.530
Let's head over there right now.

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:38.470
So, where is he?

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:39.950
At the fencing hall.

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:41.760
Arima is...

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:43.030
...dueling?

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:46.670
This is Fujikura.

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.060
It's urgent.

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:56.950
Kendo?

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:09.590
What's with him?

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:10.950
Obviously that won't work.

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:12.400
Like a pig wielding a sword.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:13.900
That doesn't matter.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:20.720
Winning in my own style wouldn't make me happy.

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:23.480
We won't bother with fencing rules.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.270
We should spar in your dojo's style, too.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:28.300
You said it.

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:29.390
Teppei-sama!

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:35.530
I guess I did.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.220
Yeah.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:39.740
Cool!

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.640
Is the edge sharp?

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:43.840
No way.  It doesn't have an edge.

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.450
Van Hossen-sama, what about your mask?

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:47.570
I don't need it.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:48.960
He's not using one, either.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.020
You seem to be having fun.

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:52.470
Really?

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.820
First edge to the body wins.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:58.430
Sure.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:00.060
No thrusts.

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.510
If you push too hard, it might hurt someone.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:03.760
Can you stop as soon as you score a touch?

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.100
Don't look down on me too much.

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:08.230
Sorry.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.830
Okay.

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:13.980
When the coin I toss reaches the floor, the match starts!

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:14.940
Sure.

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:16.910
The hall will close soon.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:19.880
Let's get this over with.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:23.830
Alright.  Let's do it.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.760
What's with Arima's stance?

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:28.080
It's the Iai.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:33.840
That's the art of attacking in the same motion as drawing the blade from the scabbard, then resheathing the sword.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:35.630
Last night,

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.050
that finishing move that he showed me...

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:41.300
...I wonder if it was a genuine single strike attack.

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:44.470
This fight will be decided in the blink of an eye.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.310
This is interesting.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:48.570
Right, let's begin!

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:50.270
One, two...!

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.660
It looks like a draw.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:06.120
No.

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:07.040
What?

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:08.790
I lost.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:10.910
You were faster.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:14.000
If this was real I'd have been dead already.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.980
We don't know much about each other yet.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:23.170
What do you say we begin to get to know each other this way?

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.050
Do you plan to go against your father's words?

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:27.600
I don't mean that.

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:29.440
It's my choice to decide.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.210
But if I went against him right at the beginning,

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:34.610
it would be too boring, right?

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:40.940
Silvie, Teppei!  You guys are awesome!

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:42.050
I love you two!

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:48.250
Let's go.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:49.750
Seika-sama!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:54.560
That nitwit Arima should've just lost by getting lots of holes run through him!

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:56.800
Hey, let me see that!

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:57.830
It's dangerous.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.500
It's not really sharp, right?

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.760
It's still dangerous!

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:09.180
How vulgar!

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:12.070
Why are you angry, Silvie?

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:14.540
Because you're riding me, that's why!

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:17.910
Eh?  But it's so much fun playing horse!

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:19.920
Why are you getting upset over this?

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.240
Hey Charlotte!

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:23.150
What if the teacher sees you!?

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:23.960
<i>Stop moving!</i>

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:24.330
Yee haa!

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:25.180
I told you to stop it!

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:32.160
What do you think of the Society Club?

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:36.790
Just now Silvie said that I should join it.

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:38.550
I think it's a good idea.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:43.900
The Society Club is where the entire school's popular and highly eligible people come together.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.990
That sounds like another one of those stiff ceremonies.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.560
What about you?  Aren't you in the Society Club?

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:51.970
I'm not qualified.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.400
The club members would look down on me.

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:58.330
If I ever tried to join, I would be a disgrace to you, Teppei-sama.

00:05:58.760 --> 00:05:59.610
No way!

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:02.940
Charlotte and Silvie said they would recommend me.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.720
What kind of club needs a recommendation to join, anyway?

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:11.830
The Society Club room is...

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:13.320
...this?

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.450
Not a <i>room</i> in this building, but...

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.000
...the whole thing!?

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:18.590
It's pretty, isn't it?

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:20.530
It's just been renovated.

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:24.640
Apart from it being pretty and all, is there a need for a club to occupy an entire building?

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:26.180
Let's go inside.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:39.060
My, if it isn't Charlotte-san and Silvia-san.

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:40.600
How do you do?

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.130
How do you do?

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:43.820
It has been a while.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.070
Huh?  That person is...

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.150
We want him to join the club!

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:51.410
Silvia and I are his references.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:54.200
I am Arima Teppei.

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:57.210
That person is Arima?!

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.030
Ah...it's Arima!

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:58.630
Incredible!

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:02.210
Ah!  I was wondering whose familiar voice that was.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.210
Well, if isn't Arima-san!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.080
Ah.  And you are...?

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:08.190
I'm Mezu Haruhiko!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.210
You're in the club too?

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:16.390
The Society Club of Shuuhou Academy is where the elite of the elites gather!

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:20.350
For me to be here is no accident---

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.480
Oh, you're...

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.020
...the girl at the cafeteria!

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:26.120
Why the hell is Arima here!?

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:29.720
This place is off-limits to those who aren't club members.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.570
This poor conduct is troublesome.

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:34.290
You certainly have a way with words.

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.850
Do you find Arima-dono's face that repulsive?

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:38.830
No one said that!

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:40.790
You talk too much.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:46.540
You who never comes to the club, may I ask what wind brought you here together with Arima-san?

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.170
What are you trying to say?

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:50.560
Exactly that.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:53.880
You flatter him the moment you hear the name Arima and you wag your tail towards him.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.890
You're no different from the common people.

00:07:56.510 --> 00:08:00.890
I am accompanying my father's close friends.

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:02.680
What do I have to be embarrassed about?

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:03.940
That's strange!

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:06.510
Why is everyone argumentative all of a sudden?

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:08.780
Arima!

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:13.010
All of a sudden you win over two of our honorary members.  How impudent.

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:17.310
Are you planning to make some confusion so you can get into this club?

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:20.680
When was I ever "won over" by Arima-dono?

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:23.490
Please refrain from making irrational and baseless accusations.

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:24.720
You are demeaning yourself.

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:30.940
As the head Representative of the Society Club, it's my responsibility to protect the club's high social status.

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:35.380
I cannot allow him to be recommended by close friends.

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:37.810
Well said, Seika-sama.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:40.810
There are requirements before you can enter the club.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:45.780
Judging from your current condition, I believe I can overlook your violations this time.

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:48.320
If you understand then please consider reviewing your image, Arima.

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:50.730
Please make sure you understand your place.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:53.910
My place, eh...

00:08:54.650 --> 00:09:00.950
Come to think of it, rumor has it that not too long ago you were the mere son of a soba shop owner, weren't you?

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:02.400
That has nothing to do with this!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.390
Look at that side of you!

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:05.980
Immediately raising your voice...

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.680
I wonder if you ever considered listening to everything the other person has to say.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:14.430
Change your lifestyle from now on, and become someone worthy of being a privileged guest of Shuuhou Academy before you come here.

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:18.600
So what if I used to own a soba shop?

00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:20.430
A soba shop...

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:22.890
Is having a soba shop a bad thing?

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:27.900
Fine!  All I have to do is become worthy of that "privileged guest" stuff and show you, right?

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:31.040
Yes, of course.

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:34.820
Oh yes, what perfect timing.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:38.410
The Society Club will be hosting a party in a week.

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.320
You are invited.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:46.550
If you can prove yourself worthy then and there, I will accept your entrance into the club.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:47.540
Understood.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.500
Don't forget what you said.

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:51.380
I'll change so much that you'll cry when you see me.

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:54.670
When you see the new me, don't you dare pee in your skirt!

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.240
Pee?!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.900
I'm telling you to fix that crude attitude of yours!

00:09:59.060 --> 00:09:59.510
Fine.

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:01.320
Don't you dare forget.

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:03.630
I'm already being forgotten...

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.750
How do you do?

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:16.780
Teppei-dono.

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:20.830
Please don't make sounds while you're drinking.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.000
How do you <i>do?</i>

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:30.420
Try to talk more naturally!

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.850
Straighten your back when you walk!

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:39.340
Yes!

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:49.390
You just yawned, didn't you?

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:55.030
How can you even think of joining the Society Club while being so carefree?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.060
Fine!  I won't yawn!

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:00.960
That's right.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:03.570
One, two, three!

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:05.700
One, two, three!

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.800
You've gotten better with your footwork already!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.000
Really?  Th---

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:12.470
No, not like that!

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.810
When you move forward, you move your legs like this!

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:16.930
You mean like this?

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:19.700
No!  Why do you lean forward anyway?

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.150
Improvisation is not allowed!

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:22.850
That was not improvisation...

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:24.980
Dancing needs to be elegant, simple and fun!

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:27.620
Oh yeah, since you've improved now...

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:28.600
Improved now...?

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.520
As a reward

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:31.610
I'll give you a kiss!

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:32.920
A kiss!?

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:38.410
A reward kiss has been given!

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:41.230
What's wrong?

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:42.320
Well, it's just, um...well...

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:42.320
Teppei?

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.560
It's hard to explain, but...

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:44.780
Does your stomach hurt?

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:45.990
No, that's not it.

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:46.630
What's going on?

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:48.460
Well, this is...!

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:41.950
Sorry for the wait.

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:43.940
Thanks.

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:44.980
Not at all.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:46.660
Can't you sleep?

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:50.510
There's too much to do.

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:52.640
I don't think I'll be able to sleep at all.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:55.860
If you drink coffee, you won't get sleepy at all.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:58.450
Well, I can't sleep anyway.

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:00.550
I've been thinking about all sorts of things lately.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.990
If you drink tea, you won't be able to sleep.

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:08.260
Well, I don't have time to sleep today.

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:11.130
I've got all sorts of things to think about.

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:12.830
All sorts of things to think about?

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:14.290
Like ecchi things?

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:15.710
Not that stuff!

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:18.880
What is it?

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:19.920
Nothing.

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:22.620
You just remind me of my mother.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:27.160
I used to ask her to get me drinks in the middle of the night, too.

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:29.450
Even though it wasn't coffee.

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:30.270
It was just tea.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.640
I wonder what I came here for anyway...

00:13:35.400 --> 00:13:37.810
In the beginning, my motives were different.

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:42.400
In no time at all, I was caught up in entering the Society Club.

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:44.910
Milord has already said it.

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:47.260
You should make your allies first.

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:50.940
I wonder if I will be able to do that well.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:54.120
I am your ally, Teppei-sama.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:57.170
Charlotte-sama and Silvia-sama are, too.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:01.850
I grew up in an orphanage built by Milord.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.020
When I was finally aware of my surroundings,

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:06.510
I had already lost my father and mother.

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:11.960
At that time, Milord came, brought me up and made me a maid.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:15.540
Milord said to me,

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:18.680
"It's okay if you don't think you can do everything immediately."

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:22.480
"Start with what you can do first, and move on slowly from there."

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:27.450
I believed in him, and tried my best.

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:31.440
"Once you are capable, come and offer your services to the Arima family."

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:34.970
I am very grateful to Milord...

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:38.980
...because I was given the opportunity to serve his successor.

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:44.130
I wonder if becoming my servant is really such a great honor.

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:48.270
Milord has great expectations of you, Teppei-sama.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:52.230
He is waiting for you to grow into adulthood.

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:57.230
I am very happy to be able to accompany you on that journey.

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:02.060
To be needed by someone...means I have a reason to exist, I believe.

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:06.570
Whether it was for something big or something small...

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:10.970
I have been impertinent towards you.  Please forgive me.

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:13.370
No, you haven't.  Thank you.

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:14.970
You're right.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:19.330
There's no other way but to give it your all!

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:20.530
Yes!

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:23.670
Well, let us practice our walking posture again!

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:25.700
Ah...fine...

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:27.910
How do you do?

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:28.680
Onee-sama!

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:29.350
How do you do?

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:30.480
Good morning.

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:33.930
You're early today.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:39.620
That's right.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.690
One, two, three!

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:43.310
One, two, three!

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:46.890
Why did you step forward again?

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.650
Ah!  Could it be the Bon Festival Dance?

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:51.290
How Japanese!

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.620
That's not it!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:56.530
What's with him working so hard, anyway...

00:15:57.110 --> 00:16:01.930
I wonder if Arima-ki's hopes for joining will be dashed at the upcoming Social Club party?

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:05.920
Yeah, Houjouin-san surely seems to hate Arima-ki, doesn't she?

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:07.360
It's...

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:14.630
It's as if I'm the villain here.

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:18.940
Hey, what do you have in your pocket?

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:19.820
Chewing gum.

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:21.960
That's pretty big for a pack of chewing gum.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:23.970
Quite big chewing gum.

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.470
Charl!  Teppei-dono!

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:28.490
Welcome back!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:29.900
Please don't come over here.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.450
It's time for tea practice.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:32.860
Please, just a moment longer!

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:38.630
H...<i>how</i> do you <i>do</i>?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:39.830
How is it?

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.210
Can't you act a bit more refined?

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.280
You won't be able to make it like this.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:48.870
People have limits.

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:50.400
Why don't we take a break?

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:51.950
Let's do that.

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.010
More practice?

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:57.320
Well, I've got no one to hang out with except Teppei-dono.

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:58.240
Same here.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.630
Escaping from reality, huh?

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.180
No, no.  We're just taking a break.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.740
Silvie's swordplay is awesome.

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:04.870
She's so fast.

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.440
No, Teppei-dono.  Your Iai is so much more interesting.

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:09.940
Eastern swordplay is just amazing.

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:12.760
Strength, power and elegance, all in one package.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:14.200
That's it!

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:20.080
Teppei-sama has also learned etiquette in martial arts, right?

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:28.460
Instead of learning so many new things, everything you have amassed so far about elegance and etiquette should seem natural to you.

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:29.670
I see.

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:31.050
That just might be it!

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:32.630
I see.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:34.430
Thank you, Yuu-san!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.540
If that's the case, then let's start from the bottom up!

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:41.800
Alright, let's do it!

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:49.590
The day has finally come!

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:52.620
Just show the results of your training and you should be fine!

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:57.160
I'll praise you just for showing up on time.

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:01.730
I'd love to see you show us whether or not you are capable of displaying the dignity of a student of the Shuuhou Academy.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:08.220
If you show that you are incapable, I'll make sure that you look foolish.

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:12.260
The condition is that you make an impression on Seika-sama.  Is that alright with you?

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:13.670
Of course!

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:18.260
As Representative of the Society Club, I don't think you would make any bad judgments.

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:21.260
Fine.  Come in.

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:40.810
It's about time, eh?

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:43.950
Arima-san!  Good morning!

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:52.830
Thank you for attending Shuuhou Academy's 151st ball today.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:56.690
I am the Society Club's Representative, Houjouin Seika.

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:00.380
Refreshments are on the western side of the building.

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:02.180
Please do not hesitate to enjoy them.

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:06.490
The school's Orchestral Music Club will play for us now.

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:08.730
Please take your time and enjoy the music.

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:55.490
Oh Teppei, you're really good at it now.

00:19:55.910 --> 00:19:56.650
Really?

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:57.450
Yeah!

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:59.610
And your hand is so warm.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:05.740
This was the hand which saved me back then, right?

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.540
So that's the Arima family's successor, eh?

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:11.720
He's marvelous!

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:14.320
But I heard he's already got a fiancée!

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:15.320
No way...

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:19.300
Why...?

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:22.660
I'm...

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:24.960
Seika-sama?

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.460
Do you feel unwell?

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:29.210
It's impossible.  There's no way!

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:32.400
Me...Houjouin Seika and him...?!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:33.850
He's just an Arima...

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:44.910
Thank you for coming to today's party organized by our school, Shuuhou Academy.

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:47.050
The organization of this ball

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:46.500
Seems like it's finally over.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:47.050
Yeah.

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:50.540
would not have been successful without the help of all who attended.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:50.540
Now all that's left is for Houjouin to pass her verdict.

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.120
Therefore I, Houjouin Seika, Representative of the Society Club,

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:52.830
We've done what we needed to.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:54.070
wish to thank you from the bottom of my heart.

00:20:56.470 --> 00:20:57.140
Arima.

00:20:57.460 --> 00:21:00.480
You have sufficiently shown me the results of your training.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:04.820
Within a short time, you have learned to display the dignity required of you.

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:06.350
You did well.

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:08.680
Isn't that great, Teppei?

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:13.570
<i>But!</i>

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:19.030
But...I'm just saying that you are not quite there yet.

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:23.280
Eh?  But everyone was full of praise for him!

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:28.280
Charlotte-san, I believe that I am the one who decides if he qualifies or not.

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:31.130
That's...true, I guess..

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:33.460
Arima Teppei.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:37.790
As a student of Shuuhou Academy, you have to do more than attend parties.

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:40.230
Hosting them is also important!

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:44.350
You will host a party in a week's time.

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:48.300
Based on what I see at that party, I will then decide whether or not to approve your membership into the club.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:50.980
Party...?

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:54.280
You mean I have to host a party!?

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:26.690
Question!

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:26.270
One,

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:26.690
two,

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:27.340
What's up?

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:27.340
three.

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:29.870
I wonder when Maria-chan will show up again?

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:28.360
One,

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:28.900
two,

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:29.870
three.

00:23:29.870 --> 00:23:31.810
It seems like she'll come again next week.

00:23:29.870 --> 00:23:31.610
Onii-chan, let's do it together!

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:33.330
Next on Princess Lover!

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:34.440
Rose and Shoe.

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:36.620
So what kind of story will next week's be anyway?

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:35.000
One,

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:35.450
two,

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:36.620
three.

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:37.750
It will be <i>my</i> story.

00:23:36.960 --> 00:23:37.380
One,

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:37.750
two,

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:39.210
Make sure you stay tuned for it!

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:39.210
three.
